  "headline": "Ceftazidime is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Hospira discontinued a presentation in 2025-11-14",
  "headline_cites": ["D6", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows ceftazidime is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A prior FDA posting records that Hospira, Inc., a Pfizer Company, discontinued manufacture of Ceftazidime Injection (package NDC 0409-5092-16) with an initial posting date of 2025-11-14.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current hospital inventory shows Corvale East holds 236 vials of the 2 g presentation at 12.9 vials per day (18.2 days on hand) and 369 vials of the 1 g presentation at 14 vials per day (26.3 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 488 vials of the 2 g presentation at 15.9 vials per day (30.7 days on hand) and 246 vials of the 1 g presentation at 15.5 vials per day (15.8 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D2", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 38 vials of the 2 g presentation at 3.2 vials per day (12 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Sagent Pharmaceuticals, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
}
